OL,3,GNEWSAProtest after homophobic and
OL,4,Aracist incidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-hate demonstrators have marched
OL,7,Fthrough Chichester after recent reports
OL,8,Fof discriminatory attacks in the city.
OL,10,FAbout 1,000 people marched peacefully
OL,11,Fthrough the city centre on Saturday
OL,12,Fwith "little disruption" and no arrests
OL,13,Fmade, according to Sussex Police.
OL,15,FThe force is investigating a report of
OL,16,Fhomophobic abuse after claims an actor
OL,17,Fwas "aggressively hounded and
OL,18,Fphysically pursued" through the West
OL,19,FSussex city before a local performance.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
